      "widgets_values": [
        "## Wan 2.2 T2V (A14B)\n\nText to video, 832×480, 81 frames (5 s at 16 fps). Two 14B experts: high noise for steps 0–10, low noise for 10–20, CFG 3.5, euler / simple, shift 8.\n\n**Models** (not in models.txt yet):\n- diffusion_models: wan2.2_t2v_high_noise_14B_fp8_scaled, wan2.2_t2v_low_noise_14B_fp8_scaled — https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Wan_2.2_ComfyUI_Repackaged\n- text_encoders: umt5_xxl_fp8_e4m3fn_scaled — https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Wan_2.1_ComfyUI_repackaged\n- vae: wan_2.1_vae — Wan_2.2_ComfyUI_Repackaged\n\n720p: 1280×704. Keep `length` at 4n+1. Saves an animated WebP; for MP4 put CreateVideo + SaveVideo after VAE Decode."
      ]
    }
